# r1113 Power Grid P4 boot (jar jar_archive/pwg_gate/backportedPowerGrid-0.6.2-ce-19.2-05.jar) with the P3 reruns on the
# fixed probe: SQ-PWG-35, forceload, SQ-PWG-26 to -34 (copied from pwg3.qb; only the ERROR rejects narrowed), SQ-PWG-36 to
# -44. Group A superflat, level pwg5, ground Y -61, blocks at Y -60.
# Prep: COPYDEV=1 PGJAR=$INST/jar_archive/pwg_gate/backportedPowerGrid-0.6.2-ce-19.2-05.jar prep_srv.sh OUT pwg5 A
#   cp pwg_probe.js, pwg_grid_probe.js, pwg_p3_probe.js, pwg_p4_probe.js into OUT/srv/kubejs/server_scripts/ as zz_*.js
# Probe goggle reads on gauges log a RuntimeDistCleaner ERROR (client class) and print "goggles skipped"; so no blanket
# /ERROR\] reject: rejects name powergrid/patryk and skip RuntimeDistCleaner lines.
# waitlog matches anywhere since the row start (first "done" satisfies every later one); real waits are sleeps
# (20 ticks = 1 s) plus pace (s after each command).
# Split rows: SQ-PWG-37cs (constant speed motor part of -37), SQ-PWG-38B (part B of -38), SQ-PWG-42s (-42 with the
# commutator wires swapped, always run: records both polarities), SQ-PWG-44pre (restores the -38 B line that -41
# rebuilt: creative motor at 256 RPM, 10 ohm load, gauge wires).
pace 1

## SQ-PWG-35 | P4 jar loads: registries, wire types, stress provider, display source, redstone converter, damage source
bootexpect Done \(
bootexpect Power grid starting, prepare to be electrocuted \(1\.19\.2 port, phase 4\)
bootexpect Loaded 5 wire types
bootreject (WARN|ERROR).*(Mixin apply failed|Mixin.*powergrid.*(error|failed)|InvalidInjectionException|InvalidMixinException|powergrid\.mixins\.json)
bootreject ^(?!.*MinecraftServer/\]: Unknown item).*(Couldn't load tag|Failed to load|Couldn't parse|Unknown item|Unknown tag|Error loading registry data).*powergrid
bootreject (ERROR|WARN).*[Ll]oot.*powergrid
bootreject Exception loading blockstate definition.*powergrid
bootreject Parsing error loading recipe powergrid:
> zpwg mods powergrid
waitlog \[zpwg\] done 30
> zpwg ns powergrid
waitlog \[zpwg\] ns powergrid total 30
> zpwg4 check
sleep 2
> give @p powergrid:electric_motor
sleep 1
