expect \[zpwg4\] stress generator_induction_rotor capacity=\S+ impact=32(\.0)? hasCapacity
expect \[zpwg4\] stress generator_large_induction_rotor capacity=\S+ impact=128(\.0)? hasCapacity
count \[zpwg4\] stress generator_(vertical_)?commutator capacity=\S+ impact=8(\.0)? hasCapacity == 2
count \[zpwg4\] stress (variac|rheostat) capacity=\S+ impact=0(\.0)? hasCapacity=\S+ hasImpact=true == 2
